        <h1 class="font-disp font-semibold text-[clamp(2.1rem,5vw,3.7rem)] leading-[1.05] tracking-[-.02em] max-w-[17ch] [font-variation-settings:'opsz'_96]">How communities are <span class="fire-text">using Bonfire.</span></h1>
        <p class="mt-[18px] text-[1.05rem] text-ink-2 max-w-[56ch]">The goal each one was chasing, the space they ended up with, and what they switched on to get there. Some we co-designed with; most we've never met.</p>

        {# rotating goal — the communities speak first #}
        <div class="mt-[34px] border-l-2 border-flame pl-[22px] min-h-[118px]">
          <p class="mb-3 font-smono text-[.64rem] tracking-[.14em] uppercase text-ink-3">What they were after</p>
          <div class="relative min-h-[82px]" id="goals">
            <div class="g relative inset-0 transition-all duration-[600ms] ease-out">
              <p class="font-disp font-normal text-[clamp(1.15rem,2.2vw,1.6rem)] leading-[1.28] m-0 max-w-[36ch] text-ink">“Readers who debate, organise and build solidarity — not an audience that reacts to articles and leaves.”</p>
              <div class="mt-3 font-smono text-[.7rem] tracking-[.06em] uppercase text-ink-3"><b class="text-flame font-normal">Jacobin</b> · a magazine</div>
            </div>
            <div class="g absolute opacity-0 translate-y-2 pointer-events-none inset-0 transition-all duration-[600ms] ease-out">
              <p class="font-disp font-normal text-[clamp(1.15rem,2.2vw,1.6rem)] leading-[1.28] m-0 max-w-[36ch] text-ink">“Somewhere people can be honest about their mental health — without it being public, permanent, or profitable to anyone.”</p>
              <div class="mt-3 font-smono text-[.7rem] tracking-[.06em] uppercase text-ink-3"><b class="text-flame font-normal">Mentaal</b> · a mental-health network</div>
