              <p class="font-disp font-normal text-[clamp(1.15rem,2.2vw,1.6rem)] leading-[1.28] m-0 max-w-[36ch] text-ink">“A town that can organise itself — without routing its neighbourhood through a global platform.”</p>
              <div class="mt-3 font-smono text-[.7rem] tracking-[.06em] uppercase text-ink-3"><b class="text-flame font-normal">Totnes Pulse</b> · a neighbourhood</div>
            </div>
            <div class="g absolute opacity-0 translate-y-2 pointer-events-none inset-0 transition-all duration-[600ms] ease-out">
