          <div><b class="block font-disp font-bold text-[1.8rem] leading-none tracking-[-.02em] text-ink">2,028</b><span class="block mt-[7px] font-smono text-[.68rem] tracking-[.09em] uppercase text-ink-3">people in them</span></div>
