    {# ===== more communities — goal-first ===== #}
    <section id="more" class="py-[60px] border-t border-ink/[0.07] scroll-mt-[70px]">
    <div class="max-w-[1180px] mx-auto px-7">
      <p class="{{ eyebrow }} text-corn">More communities</p>
      <h2 class="{{ display }} max-w-[26ch]">Different goals. <span class="font-light">Same foundation.</span></h2>
      <p class="{{ bodyp }}">Some of these we co-designed with. Others took Bonfire and built it themselves — which is rather the point.</p>

      {% set ccard = "card overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-ink/15 bg-night-2" %}
      {% set cshot = "w-full aspect-video border-b border-dashed border-ink/15 flex items-center justify-center text-center font-smono text-[.72rem] text-ink-3 p-[18px] leading-[1.6] bg-[repeating-linear-gradient(135deg,transparent_0_22px,rgba(242,236,219,.022)_22px_44px)] [&_.tag]:text-flame" %}
      {% set cbody = "flex flex-col gap-2.5 flex-1 px-6 py-[26px]" %}
      {% set cmeta = "font-smono text-[.64rem] tracking-[.11em] uppercase text-ink-3" %}
      {% set cgoal = "m-0 font-disp font-normal text-[1.12rem] leading-[1.35] text-ink" %}
      {% set chow = "text-ink-2 text-[.92rem] m-0" %}
      {% set cfoot = "mt-auto pt-3 border-t border-ink/[0.07] flex items-center gap-2.5 flex-wrap font-smono text-[.68rem] text-ink-3" %}
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 min-[861px]:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mt-[26px]">

        <div class="{{ ccard }}">
          <div class="{{ cshot }}"><span><span class="tag">[ SHOT ]</span><br>Mentaal — a private, invite-only group with careful boundaries</span></div>
          <div class="{{ cbody }}">
            <span class="{{ cmeta }}">Mental health · co-designed with us</span>
            <h3 class="font-disp font-[620] text-[1.3rem] leading-[1.1]">Mentaal</h3>
            <p class="{{ cgoal }}">“A place people can be honest about their mental health — without it being public, permanent, or profitable to anyone.”</p>
            <p class="{{ chow }}">Private by default and governed by the people it serves, with safety designed in rather than switched on afterwards. Co-designed with Ypsilon.</p>
            <div class="{{ cfoot }}"><span>◼ In co-design</span><span class="ml-auto">Story when it's live</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="{{ ccard }}">
          <div class="{{ cshot }}"><span><span class="tag">[ SHOT ]</span><br>Totnes Pulse — the town noticeboard &amp; local feeds</span></div>
          <div class="{{ cbody }}">
            <span class="{{ cmeta }}">Neighbourhood network · co-designed with us</span>
            <h3 class="font-disp font-[620] text-[1.3rem] leading-[1.1]">Totnes Pulse</h3>
            <p class="{{ cgoal }}">“A town that can organise itself — locally, without routing its neighbourhood through a global platform.”</p>
            <p class="{{ chow }}">Small, local, and specific: the kind of community the big platforms are worst at serving, and the kind Bonfire was built for.</p>
            <div class="{{ cfoot }}"><span>◼ Planned</span><span class="ml-auto">Story when it's live</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="{{ ccard }}">
          <div class="{{ cshot }}"><span><span class="tag">[ SHOT ]</span><br>Open Science Network — a researcher profile with publications &amp; DOIs</span></div>
          <div class="{{ cbody }}">
            <span class="{{ cmeta }}">Research · <span class="text-spark">built independently</span></span>
            <h3 class="font-disp font-[620] text-[1.3rem] leading-[1.1]">Open Science Network</h3>
            <p class="{{ cgoal }}">“Scholarly conversation that doesn't evaporate — findings, arguments and data that stay open, citable and out of the journals' hands.”</p>
            <p class="{{ chow }}">Researchers shaped Bonfire around how science actually works: sign in with ORCID, publications on your profile, papers that unfold with their DOI.</p>
            <div class="{{ cfoot }}"><span>◼ In development</span><a class="ml-auto text-spark hover:underline" href="https://openscience.network" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">openscience.network ↗</a></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        {# placeholder — needs real copy #}
        <div class="{{ ccard }} border-dashed">
          <div class="{{ cshot }}"><span><span class="tag">[ SHOT ]</span><br>Fondazione Cineteca dell'Etna — to fill</span></div>
          <div class="{{ cbody }}">
            <span class="{{ cmeta }}">[ sector — to fill ] · <span class="text-spark">built independently</span></span>
            <h3 class="font-disp font-[620] text-[1.3rem] leading-[1.1]">Fondazione Cineteca dell'Etna</h3>
            <p class="{{ cgoal }}">“[ One line: the goal they're chasing — to fill ]”</p>
            <p class="{{ chow }}">[ One or two lines: how they're using Bonfire to get there — to fill ]</p>
            <div class="{{ cfoot }}"><span class="text-flame">◼ Placeholder — needs your copy</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div></section>

    {# ===== invitation ===== #}
    <section id="next" class="py-[60px] border-t border-ink/[0.07] scroll-mt-[70px]">
    <div class="max-w-[1180px] mx-auto px-7">
      <p class="{{ eyebrow }} text-flame">What's next</p>
      <h2 class="{{ display }} max-w-[22ch]">The next story here <span class="font-light">could be yours.</span></h2>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 min-[821px]:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mt-[26px]">
        <div class="card rounded-xl border border-flame/40 bg-flame/[0.04] px-[26px] py-7 gap-2.5">
          <h3 class="font-disp font-[620] text-[1.3rem]">Already running Bonfire?</h3>
          <p class="text-ink-2 text-[.97rem] m-0">Then you have a story worth telling — however small. A book club, a union local, a fan community. The ones that matter most aren't the big ones; they're the ones that look like the reader.</p>
          <a class="mt-auto pt-3.5 font-smono text-[.74rem] tracking-[.05em] uppercase text-spark hover:underline" href="mailto:team@bonfire.cafe">Tell us your story →</a>
        </div>
        <div class="card rounded-xl border border-ink/15 px-[26px] py-7 gap-2.5">
          <h3 class="font-disp font-[620] text-[1.3rem]">Want a hand building it?</h3>
          <p class="text-ink-2 text-[.97rem] m-0">If your community needs something that doesn't exist yet, we can research and design it with you — and whatever we build together goes back into the commons.</p>
          <a class="mt-auto pt-3.5 font-smono text-[.74rem] tracking-[.05em] uppercase text-spark hover:underline" href="/mosaic">How Mosaic works →</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="{{ bodyp }} mt-8">Curious what each of them actually switched on? <a class="text-spark hover:underline" href="/features">See the feature matrix →</a></p>
    </div></section>

